T["Every Warlock talent tree from level 1 to 60, merged from Icy Veins, Wowhead and Method; the steps for a tree appear once you know its talent spells. Pulls with Immolate and Bane of Agony (Destruction precasts Shadow Bolt), uses Nightfall and Decimation procs, keeps Demonic Brand up with Searing Pain. While moving it casts only instants. On packs: Hellfire in a group, Rain of Fire, Corruption and Agony. Then Bane of Doom on elites and bosses or Bane of Agony, Curse of the Elements in groups and on elites, Immolate, Corruption, Siphon Life, Conflagrate and Shadowburn; solo it fills with Wrack, Drain Life (with a drain talent) or the wand; otherwise Incinerate or Shadow Bolt. Reminders: armor, a demon (Succubus, else Voidwalker, else Imp), Fel Domination, Demonic Sacrifice with Demonic Pact, Soul Link, weapon stones, Amplify Curse and Bane of Havoc for a second enemy. Left to you: sending the pet in, other curses, Fear, Healthstones and other targets. Health and mana are hidden from addons on Forever, so the execute window (Drain Soul, Shadowburn as the killing blow), Life Tap, Health Funnel and draining when hurt are your call."] = 6
