T["Levels 1–60, every talent tree, also on Hardcore and Self-Found realms; built from Wowhead, Icy Veins, Warcraft Tavern and simulator. Stops while you cast or channel and never tags a mob someone else is fighting while you are solo. Nightfall's Shadow Trance first; Shadowburn and Searing Pain to finish a group target; a solo target about to die gets Drain Soul (for a shard, or with Improved Drain Soul), Shadowburn or Conflagrate, then the wand, never new DoTs. While moving only instants. On three or more enemies: Hellfire when they are on you and you have half your health, otherwise Rain of Fire. One curse: in raids Curse of Shadow or the Elements when nobody has it, Doom on long elite fights, otherwise Agony. Immolate when it pays (Destruction, raids, or with 40% mana), Corruption, Siphon Life (in raids only on Shadow Vulnerability). Solo: Dark Pact, Life Tap when healthy, Drain Life when hurt, the wand. Shadow Bolt otherwise. Reminders: Demon Armor or Demon Skin, your pet (Voidwalker solo, Imp in a group, Succubus for Demonic Sacrifice), Fel Domination, Demonic Sacrifice, Amplify Curse, Voidwalker Sacrifice and a Healthstone when low, Health Funnel. Curse assignments, Curse of Recklessness on a fleeing mob, Fear, Banish, Soulstones and creating Healthstones stay with you."] = 20
